⚡️🇮🇷 The IRGC has just released a new statement.

 "In the third wave of Operation "Victory 2," under the motto "Ya Zein al-Abidin" (peace be upon Ali), and in honor of the people, the naval and aerospace forces of the Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps have destroyed several enemy weapon storage facilities, ship parts, and aircraft components at the Sheikh Issa base in Bahrain. This was achieved in a coordinated operation using missiles and drones, just hours ago."

